        "content": "<p>alexcrichton edited <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14585\">issue #14585</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This test:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"wasm\"><pre><span></span><code>(module $M\n  (type $t (func (result i32)))\n  (table (export \"t\") 2 funcref)\n  (func (export \"call\") (param i32) (result i32)\n    (call_indirect (type $t) (local.get 0))))\n(register \"M\" $M)\n\n(assert_trap\n  (module\n    (import \"M\" \"t\" (table 2 funcref))\n    (memory 1)\n    (func $f (result i32) (i32.load8_u (i32.const 0)))\n    (elem (table 0) (i32.const 0) func $f)\n    (elem (table 0) (i32.const 2) func $f)\n    (data (i32.const 0) \"\\2a\"))\n  \"out of bounds table access\")\n\n(assert_return (invoke $M \"call\" (i32.const 0)) (i32.const 0))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>fails:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cow</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">order</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Error</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">script</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">'</span><span class=\"na\">cow</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">order</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"o\">'</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">Caused</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">by</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">directive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">on</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cow</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">order</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">26</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">result</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">didn</span><span class=\"o\">'</span><span class=\"na\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">match</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">expected</span><span class=\"w\">                  </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x0000000000000000</span>\n<span class=\"n\">actual</span><span class=\"w\">                   </span><span class=\"mi\">42</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x000000000000002a</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The <code>data</code> segment is aplied even though there's an out-of-bounds <code>elem</code> segment.</p>\n</blockquote>",
